    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506070/extras/2b2b05828b4c800642532aed75a8382e.avif?t=1704927973\" /></span><br><br>The <strong>Wassermann</strong> is an atrocious creature who lives in streams, lakes, and caverns. They say it steals children and it is best to stay out of its way.<br><br>When arriving at your mountain cabin, you find a letter from your spouse, telling you they decided to try to get your first-born child back on their own terms, by venturing into the lair of the Wassermann.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506070/extras/ad0014200c1a3d8c7c27cc9f34e45681.avif?t=1704927973\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Very short, indie, horror game<br></li><li>Alpine setting, mostly set in a cave<br></li><li>Story inspired by Austrian folklore<br></li><li>Steam Achievements</li></ul><br>",
